{"title":"1999 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video(detailed)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video(detailed)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/d/ffdce6e35ef01134580092acb345dd34e4f99423.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(6?3) + 4 - (2 - 1) = 5.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"185\" height=\"18\" /> To make this statement true, the question mark between the 6 and the 3 should be replaced by\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/a/daaff1cb21baca2a0446a8656c83af4853887206.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\div \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ \\times \\qquad \\text{(C)} + \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ - \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\text{None of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"461\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Simplifying the given expression, we get: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/2/b62a0f0c92e0a48e1e93887327e687ba5e0ddbe2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(6?3)=2.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>At this point, it becomes clear that it should be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/5/2450fbadcdd005734557a397b35654102662a596.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(A)}\\ \\div}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"61\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video.28detailed.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video(detailed)\">Video(detailed)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video(detailed)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l6MO9uW2VTA\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l6MO9uW2VTA</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"backgroun